            <p class="text-sm text-gray-500"><strong>Last verified:</strong> 2026-09-06. Google DeepMind announced Gemini 3.8 Flash + 3.8 Flash Cyber on 2026-09-02. Google had not published the 3.8-specific context-caching, long-context, and exact model-ID strings on the API pricing page at review time - confirm them live at ai.google.dev before locking a production estimate.</p>
